    "updated_at": "2015-10-28T23:33:16Z",
    "body": "Simplified the patch, and added some text to `noreferrer` to note that it implies `noopener` in specific circumstances. Is that what you're looking for?\n\nBasically, we just tacked completely unrelated functionality onto `noreferrer` at some point in ~2011. This is an attempt to explain the behavior, and make it available separately.\n",
